<h1>Subscription cancelled</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your StudioFlow <strong><%= @tier_label %></strong> subscription has been cancelled.
  Your account has been moved to the <strong>Starter</strong> (free) plan.
</p>

<p>
  All your data is safe and your studio remains accessible on the Starter plan.
  You can re-subscribe at any time.
</p>

<a href="<%= @billing_url %>" class="btn">View plans and resubscribe</a>

<% content_for :footer do %>
  You received this email because your StudioFlow subscription was cancelled.
<% end %>
